// A binding whose value ends in ')' and another binding after it: the group
// is an operand, and what follows it is the next binding. It used to read on,
// `(X >> 1) C=2` was one expression that failed, and m lost both bindings.
#module M
#variable A:8 in = 0
#variable C:8 in = 0
#variable Out:8 out = 0
Out = A + C
#end
#variable X:8 = 6
#M m A=(X >> 1) C=2
